 against a green background with a shadow",height:1024,width:1024},{assetId:"Medical_02",title:"close up of a stethescope floating on a sparkling white cloud, bright white background",height:1024,width:1024},{assetId:"Medical_03",title:"Create a professional and trustworthy image featuring a doctor in the act of signing an important document. This scene should convey authority, expertise, and attention to detail, reflecting the doctor’s role in patient care, decision-making, and medical administration.",height:796,width:1024},{assetId:"Medical_04",title:"Microscopic view of layered tissue cells in soft pink and purple tones, forming symmetrical patterns, on a white background",height:796,width:1024},{assetId:"Medical_05",title:"Diagonal DNA double helix made of smooth magenta, twisting symmetrically on a soft pastel peach background",height:1317,width:1024},{assetId:"Medical_06",title:"closeup of a happy laughing child wearing a face mask and light yellow shirt sitting in a bright inviting doctors office with light blue wallpaper and a window in the background",height:1317,width:1024},{assetId:"Medical_07",title:"realistic; diverse medical professional reviewing medical charts; room for text",height:796,width:1024},{assetId:"Office_01",title:"Minimal government building facade in monochromatic navy tones, with modern architectural shadows and geometric lines",height:1024,width:1024},{assetId:"Office_02",title:"HR Manager smiling at candidate while conducting an Interview. Natural light with a soft fill light to reduce shadows. Professional and calm atmosphere",height:796,width:1024},{assetId:"Office_03",title:"Colorful square sticky notes in a scattered arrangement on a bold yellow background",height:1024,width:1024},{assetId:"Office_04",title:"Single metallic blue binder clip centered on a bright saturated magenta surface",height:1024,width:1024},{assetId:"Office_05",title:"Stack of documents with a pen on top, clean composition, on a blue gradient background",heig